eo\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#1f6463\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.8\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"content-wrap col-12 col-md-{{contentWidth}}\">\n        <h1 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-1\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\">\n          <b>Terms of Service</b><b><br></b></h1>\n        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-text mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"><br>Welcome to NovaFlux Tech.<br>By using our website and services, you agree to the following terms and conditions.\n<br><br>1. Introduction\n<br>\n<br>These Terms of Service govern your use of our website and the purchase of any products or services offered. By placing an order, you accept these terms in full.<br>\n<br>2. Refund Policy\n<br>\n<br>We want you to be completely satisfied with your purchase.\n<br>\n<br>    Defective or Faulty Products: If you receive a product that is defective, damaged, or not as described, you are entitled to a repair, replacement, or refund within 6 months of purchase, as per the South African Consumer Protection Act.\n<br>\n<br>    Change of Mind: If you simply change your mind, you may request a refund within 7 days of receiving the product, provided the item is unused, unopened, and in its original packaging. Return shipping costs will be for your account.\n<br>\n<br>    Digital Services / Custom Work: Due to the nature of digital services and custom work, refunds are not available once work has commenced, unless the service is not delivered as agreed.\n<br>\n<br>    Processing Time: Approved refunds will be processed within 15 business days and will be paid back to the original payment method used.\n<br>\n<br>3. Cancellation Policy\n<br>\n<br>    Cooling-Off Period: You have the right to cancel your order within 7 days of placing it, without giving a reason, as long as the work has not yet begun or the product has not been dispatched.\n<br>\n<br>    Service Cancellations: If you wish to cancel a service (e.g., IT support, website maintenance), please provide 7 days' written notice. Any work already completed will be billed proportionally.\n<br>\n<br>    Failure to Deliver: If we are unable to deliver your order within 30 days of purchase, we will notify you and issue a full refund within 30 days of that notification.\n<br>\n<br>4. Delivery Policy\n<br>\n<br>    Physical Products: If applicable, goods will be dispatched within 7 business days of order confirmation. Delivery times depend on the courier service used.\n<br>\n<br>    Digital Products / Services: Delivery of digital products (e.g., websites, software, design files) will be delivered electronically via email or a secure download link within the agreed timeframe.\n<br>\n<br>    Risk of Loss: Once the product is delivered to the courier, risk of loss or damage passes to the customer. If your item arrives damaged, please contact us within 48 hours of receipt.\n<br>\n<br>5. Payment Terms\n<br>\n<br>    All payments are processed securely via Payfast.\n<br>\n<br>    By making a purchase, you confirm that you are authorised to use the payment method provided.\n<br>\n<br>    We reserve the right to cancel any order if payment is not received or is declined.\n<br>\n<br>6. Privacy Policy (POPIA Compliance)\n<br>\n<br>We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal information in accordance with the Protection of Personal Information Act (POPIA) .\n<br>\n<br>    We collect personal information (e.g., name, email, phone number) only to process orders and provide services.\n<br>\n<br>    Your information will not be shared with third parties except where necessary to fulfil your order (e.g., courier services, payment processing).\n<br>\n<br>    You have the right to request access to, or deletion of, your personal data at any time.\n<br>\n<br>7. Limitation of Liability\n<br>\n<br>    Our services and products are provided \"as is.\" We do not guarantee that our website or services will be error-free or uninterrupted.\n<br>\n<br>    To the fullest extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from the use of our products or services.\n<br>\n<br>8. Governing Law\n<br>\n<br>These terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of South Africa. Any disputes will be handled in the appropriate South African courts.\n<br>9. Changes to These Terms\n<br>\n<br>We reserve the right to update these terms at any time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated date. Continued use of our website after changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.\n<br>10. Contact Information\n<br>\n<br>If you have any questions about these terms, please contact us:\n<br>\n<br>Email: <a href=\"mailto:NovaFlux.Tech@proton.me\" class=\"text-primary\">NovaFlux.Tech@proton.me</a>\n<br>Phone: <a href=\"tel:0688759339\" class=\"text-primary\">068 875 9339</a>\n<br>Business Name: NovaFlux Tech<br></p>\n        <div class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\" mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\">\n          <a class=\"btn btn-warning\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n            Download Software\n          </a>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"mbr-fonts-style mbr-description mt-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showDescription\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-description\">\n          Compatible with Windows and macOS.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
